WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
My biggest influence would have to be Andy Warhol.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.460
He’s a big asshole, but in general he just had this ability to make the mundane awesome.

3
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:16.800
And I think that’s like . . . so dope, because that’s maybe at the heart of my work.

4
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.720
Appreciating the normal person and parts of life that are often overlooked.
